<title>USA: Sunbeam sees asset sales finished by March.</title>
<headline>Sunbeam sees asset sales finished by March.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunbeam Corp said on Wednesday it has completed the lion's share of its restructuring and expected to sell some other businesses by the end of March.</p>
<p>&quot;The remaining businesses currently for sale -- outdoor furniture, Counselor and Borg scales and the Biddeford textile factory -- are expected to be sold during the first quarter of 1997,&quot; the household goods maker said in its year-end earnings report.</p>
</text>
